可以，快照我已经做好了，不用你从 Power BI 里导。附件 `Scale_Price_snapshot_10Nov2026.txt` 就是你 11:21 发我的那个 pbix 里存着的 Scale_Price：205,205 行、13 列，原样导出（只要这之后它没有成功刷新过，就和你现在 pbix 里的是同一份）。把 Scale_Price 的查询从读 SQL 换成读这个文件，Close & Apply 和以后的 Refresh 就都不会再碰那个坏掉的 view。表名、列名、列类型都不变，ZMMRP[Scale Price USD] 这个计算列照常算。

**步骤**

1. 把附件存到和 `iCruise_CR_PBI_Input_v25.xlsx` 同一个文件夹（按 pbix 里的 SourceFile，是 `C:\Users\H329097\OneDrive - Halliburton\Desktop\`）。文件名不要改，也不要用 Excel 打开再保存。
2. Transform data，左边点 **Scale_Price**，Home > Advanced Editor，全删，粘贴下面这段，Done。预览应该出 13 列数据。如果弹出隐私级别的提示，按第 0 部分把 Privacy 设成 Ignore。
3. Close & Apply。Include in report refresh 勾不勾都可以。

```powerquery
let
    // Snapshot of Scale_Price as it was loaded in this pbix on 10 Nov 2026.
    // The SQL view behind it (PowerBI.STAGING.V_ZCLS_PRICE_SCALES_REPORTING) no longer runs, so this reads a saved copy.
    // The file must sit in the same folder as the Excel input (the SourceFile parameter).
    Cut = List.Max({Text.PositionOf(SourceFile, "\", Occurrence.Last), Text.PositionOf(SourceFile, "/", Occurrence.Last)}),
    Folder = Text.Start(SourceFile, Cut + 1),
    Source = Csv.Document(File.Contents(Folder & "Scale_Price_snapshot_10Nov2026.txt"),
        [Delimiter = "#(tab)", Columns = 13, Encoding = 65001, QuoteStyle = QuoteStyle.None]),
    Promoted = Table.PromoteHeaders(Source, [PromoteAllScalars = true]),
    NoEmptyText = Table.ReplaceValue(Promoted, "", null, Replacer.ReplaceValue, Table.ColumnNames(Promoted)),
    NoBlankRows = Table.SelectRows(NoEmptyText, each [PART_NUMBER] <> null),
    Typed = Table.TransformColumnTypes(NoBlankRows, {
        {"VENDOR_CODE",                 type text},
        {"VENDOR_NAME",                 type text},
        {"PART_NUMBER",                 type text},
        {"PRICING_UNIT",                type number},
        {"SCALE_QTY",                   type number},
        {"UOM",                         type text},
        {"PRICE_PER_PRICING_UNIT",      type number},
        {"PRICE_PER_UNIT",              type number},
        {"PRICE_PER_PRICING_UNIT_USD",  type number},
        {"PRICE_PER_UNIT_USD",          type number},
        {"COND_CURRENCY",               type text},
        {"EXCHNG_RT",                   type number},
        {"VALID_TO",                    type datetime}
    }, "en-US"),
    #"Trimmed Vendor" = Table.TransformColumns(Typed, {
        {"VENDOR_CODE", each Text.TrimStart(_, "0"), type text}
    })
in
    #"Trimmed Vendor"
```

**对数**（DAX query view）

```dax
EVALUATE
    ROW (
        "Rows", COUNTROWS ( Scale_Price ),
        "PNs", DISTINCTCOUNT ( Scale_Price[PART_NUMBER] ),
        "Vendors", DISTINCTCOUNT ( Scale_Price[VENDOR_CODE] ),
        "Sum price per unit USD", SUM ( Scale_Price[PRICE_PER_UNIT_USD] ),
        "Blank exchange rate", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( Scale_Price, ISBLANK ( Scale_Price[EXCHNG_RT] ) ) ),
        "ZMMRP lines with a scale price", COUNTROWS ( FILTER ( ZMMRP, NOT ISBLANK ( ZMMRP[Scale Price USD] ) ) )
    )
```

